Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?perf(web):=20=D0=B1=D0=B5=D0=B7=20html:has(...)?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E2=80=94=20=D0=BC=D0=B5=D1=82=D0=BA=D0=B0=20data-t3patch-me?=
 =?UTF-8?q?nu-open=20(=D0=B4=D0=BE=D0=BB=D0=B3=D0=B8=D0=B5=20=D0=BA=D0=B0?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=D0=B4=D1=80=D1=8B=20=D0=B2=20Safari)?=
